WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.970
[dance music]

00:00:02.970 --> 00:00:07.474
♪ ♪

00:00:07.474 --> 00:00:11.411
- OH, DAMN!

00:00:11.411 --> 00:00:15.949
CHECK THAT [bleep] OUT.

00:00:15.949 --> 00:00:20.053
- WHAT IS THAT?
- WHOO!

00:00:20.053 --> 00:00:21.221
I DIDN'T KNOW
THEY MADE 'EM LIKE THAT.

00:00:21.221 --> 00:00:23.156
[laughs]

00:00:23.156 --> 00:00:25.459
- I DON'T EVEN UNDERSTAND
WHAT I'M SEEING.

00:00:25.459 --> 00:00:28.896
- MM. WHOO-WHOO!

00:00:28.896 --> 00:00:30.764
I WOULD LOVE TO SEE
WHAT'S UNDER THERE.

00:00:30.764 --> 00:00:34.635
- I AM REALLY CURIOUS
ABOUT THAT.

00:00:34.635 --> 00:00:37.237
- [laughs]
YEAH, DOG, YEAH.

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:41.375
- I MEAN, I HAVE NO IDEA.
- WELL, YOU KNOW, WE, UH--

00:00:41.375 --> 00:00:45.812
WE OBVIOUSLY HAVE SOME IDEA,
YOU KNOW?

00:00:45.812 --> 00:00:48.549
- I DON'T.

00:00:48.549 --> 00:00:52.653
- WELL, YOU KNOW, IT'S, UH--
YOU KNOW, IT'S A COOCHIE, BABY.

00:00:52.653 --> 00:00:55.856
- YEAH.
OR SOMETHING.

00:00:55.856 --> 00:00:58.992
- UH, NO, NO, NO, MAN.
IT'S--IT'S DEFINITELY

00:00:58.992 --> 00:01:01.728
HER LADY PARTS.
[laughs]

00:01:01.728 --> 00:01:06.133
- OR, MAYBE
IT'S JUST MORE SKIN.

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:08.902
- NOPE.
IT--IT'S A VAGINA.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:12.773
- YEAH. OR, MAYBE IT'S
A LITTLE FACE UNDER THERE.

00:01:15.275 --> 00:01:19.346
- UH, NO. NO, IT'S--IT'S
DEFINITELY GONNA BE A VAGINA.

00:01:19.346 --> 00:01:21.515
- WHY?

00:01:21.515 --> 00:01:24.651
- BE--BECAUSE SHE'S A GIRL,
AND GIRLS HAVE VAGINAS, MAN.

00:01:24.651 --> 00:01:27.521
- WHAT IS THAT?

00:01:27.521 --> 00:01:29.790
- WHAT IS A VAGINA?

00:01:29.790 --> 00:01:32.059
IT'S A WOMAN'S
REPRODUCTIVE ORGAN.

00:01:32.059 --> 00:01:35.395
WHA--ARE YOU BEING SERIOUS
RIGHT NOW?

00:01:35.395 --> 00:01:40.901
[eerie music]

00:01:40.901 --> 00:01:46.540
- [deep voice] THANK YOU.
THAT IS ALL I REQUIRE.

00:01:46.540 --> 00:01:48.208
[shimmering]
- OH!

00:01:48.208 --> 00:01:51.144
OH, [bleep].
THERE'S ALIENS!

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:53.213
THERE'S A ALIEN DOWN THERE.

